{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up or Down?</strong> is a dark choice-driven visual novel in which you choose which guests will be evacuated from the Deluxe Resort. Talk to them, search them, and if they prove suspicious, be sure to do what you must, bellhop! Will you manage to evacuate only healthy guests, or will you end up killing everyone?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/d0049d98129e2061ddf068a57d9f8c90.avif?t=1766868340\" width=1535 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/3cc55870060df437d6acf6c9a5b1304e.poster.avif?t=1766868340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/3cc55870060df437d6acf6c9a5b1304e.webm?t=1766868340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/3cc55870060df437d6acf6c9a5b1304e.mp4?t=1766868340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to greet the colorful guests of Deluxe Resort, one encounter at a time. Interrogate them and decide whether they will join you in the elevator. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/0c1cad790c408da329b68b74c85678ea.avif?t=1766868340\" width=1535 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/cc20ba3b20daeb2e24ae514fb62b2f31.poster.avif?t=1766868340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/cc20ba3b20daeb2e24ae514fb62b2f31.webm?t=1766868340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/cc20ba3b20daeb2e24ae514fb62b2f31.mp4?t=1766868340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't allow any sick inside! Watch the news. Recognize the symptoms. Some guests will seem restless, others will try to fool you. Don't let them. Search them instead. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/ebd85a323f4537144f8413a884d60d70.avif?t=1766868340\" width=1535 height=241 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/120d2183db82829dfb7e5cfd695422ad.poster.avif?t=1766868340\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/120d2183db82829dfb7e5cfd695422ad.webm?t=1766868340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533080/extras/120d2183db82829dfb7e5cfd695422ad.mp4?t=1766868340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sick will kill if not identified in time. Do not hesitate to eliminate those guests who raise suspicion. Don't kill any innocent. Lives are at stake here, bellhop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up or Down?</strong> features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Impactful choices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 different outcomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 